Tabarchy's Menu.qml, MenuModel.js, and BarWidget.qml are derived from
Omarchy's first-party omarchy.menu plugin (David Heinemeier Hansson).

Tabarchy-specific behavior lives in Bangs.js, Cli.qml, Scanner.qml,
ChoiceDialog.qml, patches/menu.patch, bin/omarchy-tabarchy-search,
bin/tabarchy-pkg-search, and bin/tabarchy-open.
